# Events, timed calls and vector delinking (plans/RISCOS-EMULATOR.md §4.2):
# each event's enable count as the machine starts it, a disable at zero, the
# intervals OS_CallAfter and OS_CallEvery take, and the buffer
# OS_DelinkApplication writes.

